OL,3,GNEWSATrain delays as track faults spark
OL,4,Asafety fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn emergency train timetable has been
OL,7,Fimposed in south Essex after faults
OL,8,Fwere found on the railway track.
OL,10,FServices between Wickford and
OL,11,FSouthminster are running at a 30mph
OL,12,F(48km/h) speed restriction due to the
OL,13,Fissue.
OL,15,FGreater Anglia said the faults were
OL,16,Ffound during a safety inspection of the
OL,17,Ftrack earlier.
OL,19,FThe line has been under intense
OL,20,Fscrutiny after a train carrying 62
OL,21,Fpassengers derailed near Wickford on 14
OL,22,FAugust.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
